=== layout: two-panels

# *Deletion Mapping*

@left

![Five deleted intervals aligned to chromosome positions 1 through 6](assets/lect11d-chromo_alter_1-deletions/deletion_intervals.drawn.svg)

@right

Six bands in a salivary gland chromosome of _Drosophila_ are shown, along with the extent of five deletions (Del 1-Del 5).

Recessive alleles _a_, _b_, _c_, _d_, _e_, and _f_ are known to be in the region, but their order is unknown.

When the deletions are heterozygous with each allele, the results on the next slide are obtained.

Infer the gene order.

